{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31084","headline":"天际识归舟 · 薛能","name":"天际识归舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斜日满江楼，天涯照背流。\n同人在何处，远目认孤舟。\n帆省当时席，歌声旧日讴。\n人浮津济晚，棹倚泬寥秋。\n晴阔忻全见，归迟怪久游。\n离居意无限，贪此望难休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}